# Shell scripts run on Linux (Render). CRLF makes the shebang fail with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", so pin them to LF regardless of
# the checkout platform or a developer's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Normalise everything else, but leave binaries alone.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
